# Build output
firmware/.pio/
tests/**/build/
*.o
*.elf

# Generated at build time, both of them, by firmware/tools/gen_*.py.
# build_stamp.h is a property of one build on one machine, so it is never
# committed. web_assets.h IS committed: it is the GUI baked into the image, and
# a checkout has to build without a working Python to regenerate it.
firmware/src/app/build_stamp.h

# Real Wi-Fi credentials in clear text. The template beside it
# (wifi_default.example.h) is tracked; this file never is. See the Quick start
# in README.md, step 4. If this file has ever been pushed, the password in it
# should be treated as public and changed on the router.
firmware/include/wifi_default.h

# Local editor and tooling state
.vscode/
.idea/

# macOS, Windows, and CAD package scratch files
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
~$*
*.tmp
*.bak
*.autosave

# Large media does not belong in normal git history - see media/README.md.
# Nothing here is ignored by default, because the photos and the CAD are part of
# the project; this is the reminder to set Git LFS up BEFORE the first commit of
# anything large, since files committed beforehand are not moved retroactively.
